000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     SEDIABST.
000400 DATE-WRITTEN.   13 MAY 1991.
000500 DATE-COMPILED.
000600 INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
000700*REMARKS.
000800**************************************************************
000900*                                                            *
001000*     SEDIABST   EXECUTIVE PROGRAM FOR ABSTRACTING EDI DATA  *
001100*                                                            *
001200*     SELECTION CRITERIA BASED ON PO-NUMBER,                 *
001300*                                 BATCH-NUMBER.              *
001400*                                                            *
001500*     THIS PROGRAM ACCEPTS SELECTION CRITERIA,               *
001600*     ABSTRACTS RELATED DATA FROM DATA SETS AND CREATES A    *
001700*     FLAT FILE THAT IS TO BE TRANSMITTED VIA RJE. THERE     *
001800*     ARE SEVERAL RECORD FORMATS AS WELL AS HEADER AND       *
001900*     TRAILER RECORDS PER PO AND BATCH WRITTEN TO THIS FILE. *
002000*                                                            *
002100**************************************************************
      *C
      *C MAY 26, 1998    CA YODER
      *C    CHANGED "222" TO BE A STAND-ALONE ORDER (SA) AND
      *C    "225" TO BE A REPAIR ORDER (RR).
      *C
      *C 06/17/1998   CA YODER
      *C    ADDED THE FOLLOWING SUB-TRANSACTIONS TO THE 850:
      *C       04=CHANGE/MODIFY
      *C
      *C  06/02/99   CA YODER   (DECATUR REQUEST)
      *C    EXPANDED TAX RATE PERCENTAGE FROM 2 DECIMAL
      *C    PLACES TO 4.
      *C
      *C  04/24/00   JE COFFMAN
      *C    ADDED SAME CHANGES THAT WERE MADE TO TEDIABST TO
      *C    PREVENT THE PLANTS FROM SENDING A PURCHASE ORDER
      *C    THAT DOES NOT HAVE ANY ITEM SEGMENTS. EDI SUPPORT
      *C    HAS REPORTED THIS SEVERAL TIMES AND EACH TIME I
      *C    FIND A HEADER RECORD BUT NO ITEM SEGMENT AT THE
      *C    PLANT.
      *C
002200
