           MOVE SPACES                  TO HOLD-SUB-TRANS.

      *--------- IS IT A NEW PO OR REPLACEMENT?
           IF LOG-FLAG-A = "X"
               MOVE "00"                TO HOLD-SUB-TRANS
           ELSE
               MOVE "05"                TO HOLD-SUB-TRANS.

      *----- IF PLANT IS USING OTHER EDI OPTIONS (IN DVENDOR), FIND
      *----- OUT WHICH ONES APPLY.

      *--------- IS IT A MODIFIED PO?
           IF SAVE-CHANGE = "X"
             IF LOG-FLAG-M = "X" OR
                   (LOG-FLAG-D = "X" AND LOG-ITEM-NO-X > "0000")
               MOVE "04"                TO HOLD-SUB-TRANS.

