               ELSE
               MOVE ZEROES          TO MTAX-TOTAL
               ADD MTAX-PERCENT (1) TO MTAX-TOTAL
               ADD MTAX-PERCENT (2) TO MTAX-TOTAL
               ADD MTAX-PERCENT (3) TO MTAX-TOTAL
               ADD MTAX-PERCENT (4) TO MTAX-TOTAL
               IF MTAX-TOTAL = ZEROES
